msgctxt "LogMessage:10469:0:5"
msgid "Your next quest objective requires <sheet EventTutorial $n1 1>.<if ($n2 > 0)> You will have <num $n2> seconds to complete the objective.</if><br>Learn more about this quest objective via the <icon 182> icon in the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Duty List</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
