msgctxt "LogMessage:10750:0:5"
msgid "You obtain <if ($n2 > 1)><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1><else><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы получаете <if ($n2 > 1)><num $n2> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1><else><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></if>."

#. ja: 「<sheet EObj $n1 0>」で充填しよう。
#. de: An <noun-de EObj 5 $n1 1 3 1> Energie laden.
#. fr: Rechargez-le en énergie à <noun-fr EObj 1 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:10751:0:5"
msgid "Replenish energy reserves using <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Пополните запас энергии с помощью <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は所持数の上限に達しているため、入手できませんでした。
#. de: Du konntest <noun-de Item 4 $n1 2 4 1> erhalten, da du die Obergrenze erreicht hast.
#. fr: Vous ne pouvez pas obtenir davantage <noun-fr Item 8 $n1 2 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:10752:0:5"
msgid "You cannot carry any more <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Вы больше не можете нести <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>はこれ以上<sheet Item $n1 0>を所持できないため、採集が行えません。
#. de: Das Sammeln ist nicht möglich, weil <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> <noun-de Item 4 $n1 1 4 1> mehr besitzen <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>kannst<else>kann</if>.
