msgctxt "LogMessage:10792:0:5"
msgid "Contribution appraisals are now underway. All contributions made until <set-time $n1><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> will be recorded.<br>Further details can be found under “<sheet DescriptionString 1297 0 24>” in your exotablet.<br>※Server maintenance may be carried out during the appraisal period."
